NPCs: {
	RainbowFishSpawner.DisplayName: Rainbow Fish Spawner

	Ninja: {
		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: I appreciate everything you've done for me, I am content.
			NoHome: If you could give me a home, I would very much appreciate it.
			FarFromHome: I've spent enough time far from my home, now and before.
			LoveSpace: The peace and silence of solitude is amazing for meditation - when there aren't clamoring beasts around.
			DislikeCrowded: Being around this many people starts to become frustrating after a while.
			HateCrowded: Too many people here, I feel like I'm being squished in gel!
			LikeBiome: I like living in this kind of biome, reminds me of home.
			DislikeBiome: I don't enjoy this biome very much.
			HateBiome: This place is abominable, if you can, please move me somewhere else!
			//LikeNPC: "I like {NPCName}."
			DislikeNPC_Merchant: The greed of {NPCName} disgusts me.
			HateNPC_Angler: "{NPCName} is a disappointment to his lineage. Where I come from kids like that would have been straightened out."
			LikeNPC_Princess: I like {NPCName}, her poise truly reflects her royal heritage.
			Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is so cool, I always wanted to meet a real-life ninja!"
			LikeNPC: "{NPCName} is nice to be around."
			DislikeNPC: "{NPCName} has a repulsive personality."
			HateNPC: "{NPCName} is a disappointment to his lineage. Where I come from kids like that would have been straightened out."
		}
	}

