Dialogue: {
	Fishman: {
		AnglerDia: Havve you seen *snort* {0} around? Ivv so, give 'im no quarter.
		PirateDia: Me hearty {0} and I go way back, although he've always been a bit 'loaded to the gunwales', ivv you knows what I mean.
		FishmanDia2: Yous seems like the adventurin' type, so maybees you'll be interested in my *Snort* magicals bait. Theys only work in powerful places, so I hear.
		StandardDialogue1: I'vve no interest *snort* in your moneys, many a chests o' gold have me.
		StandardDialogue2: *Snort* whats havve ye pulled meself up for?
		StandardDialogue3: Maybees you've interest in me booty? Mine treasure I mean, harharhar.
		StandardDialogue4: I be a little squiffy, but me wares be fine!
		StandardDialogue5: I's won't stick around for long, me sea legs havve no care for land.
		StandardDialogue6: Fresh fish. Easy choose.
		StandardDialogue7: Summs of those fish from the evil ain't the friendliest, so bees careful fishin' thurr.
	}

	GoldenWishingFish: {
		WishDia: If you let me free, I'll fulfill you a wish!
		WishGrantedDia: Your wish is my command!
		EvilWish1: You really thought I would grant you a wish? Muahahaha!
		CheatWish: How dare you try to cheat the system like that!
	}

	SpectralMirrorman: {
		GuideDia: Judgyyng by myyy, for lack of a better word, 'freedom', I find it safe to assume you've learned the truth about your guide, '{0}', haven't you?
		WizardDia: Yous seems like the adventurin' type, so maybees you'll be interested in my *Snort* magicals bait. Theys only work in powerful places, so I hear.
		MoonDia: Some say that during a full moon, if you stare hard enough, you may see a great figure squirming about upon its surface. What do you think about that?
		StandardDialogue1: I give you this warning; gaze too long and you might end up somewhere you don't want to be.
		StandardDialogue2: ...
		StandardDialogue3: Ahh, I can tell. You were the one that set us free, weren't you?
		StandardDialogue4: Ahh, I can tell. You are the one that set us free, aren't you?
		StandardDialogue5: If only you knew how useful you are.
		StandardDialogue6: Is my... appearance, unsettling to you? My apologies, I simply tried to appear as something you might find... comforting.
		StandardDialogue7: You may find my services... useful, to you. As long as you bring me what I need for... well, I think that's enough.
	}
}

